WEBVTT

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.102
Correct "dissuade."

00:19:03.999 --> 00:19:05.153
Not "just."

00:19:07.248 --> 00:19:08.930
Ok, this is not an ideal situation,

00:19:08.954 --> 00:19:11.493
because it's getting the echo
from the hall and stuff.

00:19:11.517 --> 00:19:15.753
The point is, I can respond to people
very quickly by saying a short word,

00:19:15.777 --> 00:19:17.849
and having it write out
a much longer thing.

00:19:17.873 --> 00:19:20.239
So if somebody
sends me a fan letter, I'll say,

00:19:20.263 --> 00:19:21.420
"Thanks for that."

00:19:21.444 --> 00:19:23.951
[Thank you so much
for taking the time to write ...]

00:19:23.975 --> 00:19:24.976
(Laughter)

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.976
(Applause)

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:32.438
And conversely, if somebody
sends me hate mail --